  "description": "The phrase 'the floor is jews' is a modern antisemitic trope that implies Jewish people are secretly controlling or manipulating global systems, economies, or institutions. This stereotype is rooted in centuries of antisemitic conspiracy theories and is used to dehumanize and demonize Jewish people. It is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the hateful intent of the meme.",
